BTW EXTRA CREDIT: nested loops with separate counters and loop labels
HAI
  WAZZUP
    I HAS A row ITZ 1
    I HAS A column ITZ 1
  BUHBYE

  IM IN YR rows UPPIN YR row TIL BOTH SAEM row AN 3
    column R 1
    IM IN YR columns UPPIN YR column TIL BOTH SAEM column AN 4
      VISIBLE "seat " + row + "-" + column
    IM OUTTA YR columns
  IM OUTTA YR rows
KTHXBYE

BTW EXPECTED OUTPUT:
BTW seat 1-1
BTW seat 1-2
BTW seat 1-3
BTW seat 2-1
BTW seat 2-2
BTW seat 2-3
